CofactVLA research code preparation

This source distribution includes modified code from Hugging Face LeRobot
(https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot), with its existing Apache-2.0 license
and source copyright notices retained. The supplied checkout's HEAD was
913041e7 (fix(ci): latest deps tests permissions (#3296)); this identifies
upstream provenance, not the final CofactVLA experiment revision.

PI05 includes components attributed in the source to Physical Intelligence / OpenPI.
The PiPer adapter was recovered from the accompanying author-provided
lerobot-piper source directory. The vendor SDK is installed separately.

CofactVLA modifications concern the PI05 counterfactual branches, action
projection, feature covariance intervention, experiment launchers and PiPer
integration. This repository is not an official Hugging Face release.

See docs/release/IMPLEMENTATION.md for the modifications made in this cleanup.
Dataset and model weights are not redistributed in this source snapshot.
